        {
          "version": "0.1.6",
          "date": "2026-10-27",
          "notes": "Fixed hosting over Steam: the room was being closed right after it was created, so joiners always got room does not exist. Rooms now stay open and can be found by their room number. Both players need the Steam client open and signed in, on two different Steam accounts, and both need version 0.1.6."
        },
        {
          "version": "0.1.5",
          "date": "2026-10-27",
          "notes": "Rewrote Steam hosting and joining to match the working Human Resources setup: the player joins the Steam room first, then connects to the host. Added a version check, and the main menu now shows Steam status. Both players need the Steam client open and signed in, on two different Steam accounts, and both need version 0.1.5."
        },
        {
          "version": "0.1.4",
          "date": "2026-10-27",
          "notes": "Fixed joining a room by number: players could find a room but not connect to it. Joining now connects straight to the host through Steam. Both players need the Steam client open and signed in, and both need version 0.1.4."
        },
        {
          "version": "0.1.3",
          "date": "2026-10-27",
          "notes": "Fixed joining by room number across different computers: room search is now worldwide and retries while a new room appears. The host and join screens now show whether rooms run through Steam, and why if Steam is not available. Steam is now told which app the game belongs to so it works from the launcher. Both players need the Steam client open and signed in, and both need version 0.1.3."
        },
